  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pair: None (but related: ⟦{負|ま}ける→負ける：01134_makeru⟧ = to lose). Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|か}つ (win against X / win at X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state. {勝|か}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is winning' (current lead) or 'has won.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{試合|しあい}→試合：01601_shiai⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|か}つ (win a game)\n- ⟦{相手|あいて}→相手：01677_aite⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|か}つ (beat an opponent)\n- 3⟦{対|たい}→対：03382_tai⟧2⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{勝|か}つ (win 3 to 2)\n- ⟦{誘惑|ゆうわく}→誘惑：14209_yuuwaku⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{勝|か}つ (overcome temptation)\n- ⟦{勝|か}ち{負|ま}け→勝ち負け：11928_kachimake⟧ (win or lose—noun)\n\nOPPOSITE: ⟦{負|ま}ける→負ける：01134_makeru⟧ (to lose)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{勝|か}ち→勝ち：02540_kachi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{行|い}く→行く：00119_iku⟧ (go for the win)\n- {勝|か}ち{残|のこ}る (survive as winner)\n\nREGISTER: Neutral.",
